    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chronoquartz, every move matters! You have 10 turns per loop: explore, solve puzzles, and use your past knowledge to progress. Strategy, critical thinking, and time management will be your allies in this unique temporal adventure. Will you succeed in saving time?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Move Counts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chronoquartz, your number of moves is limited. You'll need to be clever to make the most of the 10 turns you're given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/5d179d5e8d197fed288bd75607c49283.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/5d179d5e8d197fed288bd75607c49283.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/5d179d5e8d197fed288bd75607c49283.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Loops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to use the knowledge gained from previous loops to progress further in the game. This will allow you to open coded doors, take secret passages, know the location of objects, and discover the fastest paths to reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/0602b96435b1a5a3ea6f51b1e74dd6b9.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/0602b96435b1a5a3ea6f51b1e74dd6b9.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/0602b96435b1a5a3ea6f51b1e74dd6b9.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each loop, you'll need to decide which path to take and which object to retrieve to reach your goal. Your number of turns is limited, so choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/02902ea9b96f3d94dc78ce682d9d8c4b.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/02902ea9b96f3d94dc78ce682d9d8c4b.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/02902ea9b96f3d94dc78ce682d9d8c4b.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Temporal Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gain new insights into the game, you'll need to solve puzzles that span one or more loops. Meticulous planning is essential, because remember: every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/cadecf9f80e72560d66cbd5cae2ff72c.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/cadecf9f80e72560d66cbd5cae2ff72c.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/cadecf9f80e72560d66cbd5cae2ff72c.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the information you gather might help you thwart Morthas' plans. He wants to seize the Chronoquartz and manipulate history. Time needs you: will you succeed to save it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/68a175d9de03dfde25c13e926151afcd.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/68a175d9de03dfde25c13e926151afcd.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/68a175d9de03dfde25c13e926151afcd.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chronoquartz, every move matters! You have 10 turns per loop: explore, solve puzzles, and use your past knowledge to progress. Strategy, critical thinking, and time management will be your allies in this unique temporal adventure. Will you succeed in saving time?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Move Counts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chronoquartz, your number of moves is limited. You'll need to be clever to make the most of the 10 turns you're given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/5d179d5e8d197fed288bd75607c49283.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/5d179d5e8d197fed288bd75607c49283.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/5d179d5e8d197fed288bd75607c49283.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Loops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to use the knowledge gained from previous loops to progress further in the game. This will allow you to open coded doors, take secret passages, know the location of objects, and discover the fastest paths to reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/0602b96435b1a5a3ea6f51b1e74dd6b9.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/0602b96435b1a5a3ea6f51b1e74dd6b9.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/0602b96435b1a5a3ea6f51b1e74dd6b9.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each loop, you'll need to decide which path to take and which object to retrieve to reach your goal. Your number of turns is limited, so choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/02902ea9b96f3d94dc78ce682d9d8c4b.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/02902ea9b96f3d94dc78ce682d9d8c4b.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/02902ea9b96f3d94dc78ce682d9d8c4b.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Temporal Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gain new insights into the game, you'll need to solve puzzles that span one or more loops. Meticulous planning is essential, because remember: every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/cadecf9f80e72560d66cbd5cae2ff72c.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/cadecf9f80e72560d66cbd5cae2ff72c.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/cadecf9f80e72560d66cbd5cae2ff72c.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the information you gather might help you thwart Morthas' plans. He wants to seize the Chronoquartz and manipulate history. Time needs you: will you succeed to save it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/68a175d9de03dfde25c13e926151afcd.poster.avif?t=1750081658\" width=666 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/68a175d9de03dfde25c13e926151afcd.webm?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275880/extras/68a175d9de03dfde25c13e926151afcd.mp4?t=1750081658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
